        "variant": "default",
        "eyebrow": "01",
        "title": "THE *story*",
        "heading_level": "2",
        "background": "tinted",
        "body": "I build web platforms that have to cope with real use: Laravel applications, WordPress sites, and the integrations between them and the tools a business already runs on.\n\nI started adding AI to that work in 2023, once the APIs were good enough to trust with real data. I use it where it saves a client time or money, and say plainly where it doesn't.\n\nI also build my own products: Kritano, which audits websites, and cg-cms, the Laravel CMS this site runs on. They keep me honest about the advice I give."
      }
    },
